{% # theme-check-disable %}

{% comment %}
  ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
  Font Preloads — TRIMMED for LCP critical path (May 1 2026, v23)
  ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

  Pre-trim baseline: 5 font preloads from this file + 1 (GTStandard) from
  chaos_unleashed_font_preload.liquid = 6 total competing for bandwidth in
  the first ~666ms after HTML response. On Slow 4G mobile this added
  ~117KB (instrumentsans n4+n7, roboto n7, barlow n3) of contention against
  the 18.6KB poster image, causing the poster's download to take 3.6s
  instead of an expected ~700ms.

  Decision: Keep ONLY body_regular preload. The other fonts will load
  via standard CSS @font-face discovery — slightly later, but no longer
  competing on the critical path. body_regular is kept because:
    1. It's the most-used font on most pages (paragraph + UI text)
    2. It already has font-display: swap set, so no FOFT cost
    3. Some renderable text in the hero region uses it

  Verification post-deploy: confirm no perceptible FOFT on hero CTA text
  rendered with the deferred fonts. If FOFT is visible and unacceptable,
  add back ONLY the specific font(s) actually rendered above the fold —
  not all of them. Most likely candidate to add back: type_heading_font
  if hero headlines render in it.

  Original behavior preserved by:
    - body_regular preload kept intact (lines below)
    - @font-face declaration with font-display: swap kept intact
    - font_url filter still resolves correctly for non-preloaded fonts
      via the theme's CSS that references them

  v23 CHANGELOG (May 1 2026):
    Removed 4 of 5 preload <link> tags (body_bold, type_subheading_font,
    heading_bold, type_accent_font). Kept body_regular preload + its
    @font-face declaration. Original file structure preserved with
    deletions only — easy to restore if needed.
  ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
{% endcomment %}

{% # Self-host + preload body font weight 400 to eliminate font-swap CLS %}
{%- unless settings.type_body_font.system? -%}
  {%- assign body_regular = settings.type_body_font | font_modify: 'weight', '400' -%}
  {%- if body_regular != blank -%}
    <link
      rel="preload"
      as="font"
      href="{{ body_regular | font_url }}"
      type="font/woff2"
      crossorigin
    >
    <style>{{ body_regular | font_face: font_display: 'swap' }}</style>
  {%- endif -%}
{%- endunless -%}

{% # theme-check-enable %}
